{"id":"8bc80ccb6d4290e0","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-communication-rank-lower-bound.md","title":"Rank Lower Bound for Deterministic Communication","display":"thm-communication-rank-lower-bound — Rank Lower Bound for Deterministic Communication","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-communication-rank-lower-bound","aliases":["28-thm-communication-rank-lower-bound"],"display":"thm-communication-rank-lower-bound — Rank Lower Bound for Deterministic Communication","depends_on":["[[28-df-communication-matrix]]","[[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]","[[28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 13.11 and §13.2.3","source_printed_pages":"274–275","source_pdf_pages":"300–301","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-communication-rank-lower-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-communication-rank-lower-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-communication-rank-lower-bound — Rank Lower Bound for Deterministic Communication"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"05ae51253c88d36f\" href=\"?note=05ae51253c88d36f\" title=\"28-df-communication-matrix\">28-df-communication-matrix</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fec568b8ee2173ba\" href=\"?note=fec568b8ee2173ba\" title=\"28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity\">28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"58c74e9d605c12da\" href=\"?note=58c74e9d605c12da\" title=\"28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle\">28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 13.11 and §13.2.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"274–275"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"300–301"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\">\\(\\mathbb F\\)</span> 为任意域，将0、1解释为域元素。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_f,\\chi(f)\">\\(M_f,\\chi(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"05ae51253c88d36f\" href=\"?note=05ae51253c88d36f\" title=\"28-df-communication-matrix\">28-df-communication-matrix</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(f)\">\\(D(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fec568b8ee2173ba\" href=\"?note=fec568b8ee2173ba\" title=\"28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity\">28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity</a>；协议矩形结论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"58c74e9d605c12da\" href=\"?note=58c74e9d605c12da\" title=\"28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle\">28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}_{\\mathbb F}(M_f)\\le\\chi(f)\\le2^{D(f)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rank}_{\\mathbb F}(M_f)\\le\\chi(f)\\le2^{D(f)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D(f)\\ge\\left\\lceil\\log_2\\max\\{1,\\operatorname{rank}_{\\mathbb F}(M_f)\\}\\right\\rceil.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D(f)\\ge\\left\\lceil\\log_2\\max\\{1,\\operatorname{rank}_{\\mathbb F}(M_f)\\}\\right\\rceil.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将任一单色分割中的1矩形写为两个指示向量的外积，秩至多1；0矩形贡献零。相加恰等于M_f，秩次可加性给第一界，再使用最优协议的叶矩形界。max{1,rank}补足零矩阵的log0边界。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 13.11 and §13.2.3；印刷页 274–275；PDF 页 300–301。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第13章的 Rank Lower Bound for Deterministic Communication，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-communication-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"05ae51253c88d36f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-communication-matrix]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"fec568b8ee2173ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle","status":"resolved","id":"58c74e9d605c12da","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-communication-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"05ae51253c88d36f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M_f,\\chi(f)$ 见 [[28-df-communication-matrix]]；$D(f)$ 见 [[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]；协议矩形结论见 [[28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"fec568b8ee2173ba","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M_f,\\chi(f)$ 见 [[28-df-communication-matrix]]；$D(f)$ 见 [[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]；协议矩形结论见 [[28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle","status":"resolved","id":"58c74e9d605c12da","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M_f,\\chi(f)$ 见 [[28-df-communication-matrix]]；$D(f)$ 见 [[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]；协议矩形结论见 [[28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"M_f,\\chi(f)","display":false},{"tex":"D(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rank}_{\\mathbb F}(M_f)\\le\\chi(f)\\le2^{D(f)}.","display":true},{"tex":"D(f)\\ge\\left\\lceil\\log_2\\max\\{1,\\operatorname{rank}_{\\mathbb F}(M_f)\\}\\right\\rceil.","display":true}],"bytes":1923,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-342","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-communication-matrix]]、[[28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle]]、[[28-thm-communication-rank-lower-bound]]、[[28-df-discrepancy]]、[[28-thm-discrepancy-communication-bound]]、[[28-df-number-on-forehead]]。"}],"outgoing":["05ae51253c88d36f","fec568b8ee2173ba","58c74e9d605c12da"]}